   "description": "Splitting a target three ways rarely divides evenly, and the paise left over have to land somewhere or the leaves stop summing to the root. They go to the largest share, and this records which child took them - so the one person whose number is a rupee off can be told why."},
  {"fieldname": "cascade_note", "fieldtype": "Small Text", "label": "Cascade Note", "read_only": 1, "allow_on_submit": 1},

